    "F02M69/34\\": {
      "code": "F02M69/34\\",
      "level": 2,
      "parent": "F02M69/30\\",
      "ja": "燃料を機関へ供給する補助燃料回路をもつもの，例．噴射ノズルへ直接的に接続されている燃料ポンプ出口をもつもの［５］",
      "en": "with an auxiliary fuel circuit supplying fuel to the engine, e.g. with the fuel pump outlet being directly connected to the injection nozzles [5]",
      "count": 885,
      "ipcCode": "F02M69/34",
      "fTerm": "3G066",
      "childFlag": 2,
      "sourceFile": "fi_F02M.txt",
      "kind": "fi"
    },
    "F02M69/36\\": {
      "code": "F02M69/36\\",
      "level": 2,
      "parent": "F02M69/30\\",
      "ja": "インゼクタへの燃料流を変更する濃化機構をもつもの，例．燃料計量装置において，あるいは噴射ノズルへの燃料通路かあふれ通路を絞っている弁において作動することによるもの［５］",
      "en": "having an enrichment mechanism modifying fuel flow to injectors, e.g. by acting on the fuel metering device or on the valves throttling fuel passages to injection nozzles or overflow passages [5]",
      "count": 22,
      "ipcCode": "F02M69/36",
      "fTerm": "3G066",
      "childFlag": 2,
      "sourceFile": "fi_F02M.txt",
      "kind": "fi"
    },
    "F02M69/38\\": {
      "code": "F02M69/38\\",
      "level": 3,
      "parent": "F02M69/36\\",
      "ja": "燃料圧力を使用するもの，例．燃料計量装置の制御室内の燃料圧力を変えるもの（その手段が燃料のバイパス通路において燃料圧力を変えるもの，燃料圧力は噴射ノズルへの燃料流を可変的に絞るために計量され絞られた燃料圧力の作用に対して燃料絞り弁に作用しているものＦ０２Ｍ６９／２６）［２００６．０１］",
      "en": "using fuel pressure, e.g. by varying fuel pressure in the control chambers of the fuel metering device (the means varying fuel pressure in a fuel by-pass passage, the pressure acting on a throttle valve against the action of metered or throttled fuel pressure for variably throttling fuel flow to injection nozzles F02M?69/26)  [2006.01]",
      "count": 62,
      "ipcCode": "F02M69/38",
      "fTerm": "3G066",
      "childFlag": 3,
      "sourceFile": "fi_F02M.txt",
      "kind": "fi"
    },
